# Monorepo build context exclusions (Docker / Cloud Build from LogiVoice root)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.idea
.cursor
**/coverage
**/.pytest_cache

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

infra/terraform/.terraform
infra/terraform/*.tfstate
infra/terraform/*.tfstate.*
